{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9d6b4091faaa1c536ea728b3b1baa5b71289be63ce875e4ffad1813bc0aaed32","ja":"ねえ、ひびきん、風花ちゃん……。\nこの前の食レポのオンエア、見た？","zh":"我说，响、风花……\n之前那期美食探访的播出，你们看了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d7f8a89ca86e751877800c293f82246004c224cf66860766034a7e6c8e672c1d","ja":"うん！　自分が美味しそうに食べてるのを見たら、\nまたあのクレープ食べたくなっちゃったぞ！","zh":"嗯！看到自己吃得那么香的样子，\n又想去吃那个可丽饼了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a84c750e8bb567cae8db0216d8156c6b0e84083ce4169979c49f0d55f7296a7d","ja":"そうね。今度プライベートで行ってみない？\n私、あのラーメンも食べてみたいな。","zh":"好啊。下次要不要私底下去看看？\n我也想尝尝那家拉面呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5114c996c76f62a45aed82c97ff194dd4bd3e725e0f243b42ccd5907e5ffe418","ja":"自分も！\n茜のリアクション、すっごく良かったもんね！","zh":"我也觉得！\n茜的反应真的很棒呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"dee10b06a899d079552ad144863d660e0ba0ddae8a8d36c71c0d395f09d5c656","ja":"わ～～！　なんで熱いって叫んでたとこ、\nカットされてなかったの～～～！？","zh":"哇～～！为什么大喊好烫的那段，\n没有被剪掉啦～～～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"c4b3aa2d161f5ee646392d8a6bb7fbf776097f0847ef3d1bad192b4ed2b8ca5c","ja":"その前の「ふ～ふ～」ってしてるシーンだけ\n使ってくれればよかったのに……！","zh":"明明只要用之前那段“呼～呼～”吹气的镜头\n就好了嘛……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"b7c348c86c951ee05b392224ef93af8e8950967b179a41a047a01c01371ca473","ja":"ガチャッ……","zh":"咔嗒……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a2ef4d60be6f408ba966a2997df6e449d4cdc13aeab0ddaabbcb104ec012e240","ja":"あ、みなさん。さっき、食レポした番組の\nスタッフさんから連絡があったそうなんですが……。","zh":"啊，各位。刚才好像接到了美食探访节目\n工作人员的联络……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"61cf5bf67aa0e41a1757f3e42863d2123df2a9ccf22c86731d60eb993c482f69","ja":"えっ、なに！？\nもしかして、クレームがあったの！？","zh":"诶，什么！？\n难道说，有人投诉了吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"ab530096b7a3f996ca18c5c6ce0af3811029f2c16dd35422a8c726f8b1f523ee","ja":"い、いえ。むしろ、とても評判が良かったそうで、\n今度、第2弾を収録したいと。","zh":"不、不是的。不如说反响似乎非常不错，\n说是下次还想收录第2期。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1015649612ac41a320efe15282ce56f3b33f29dac5fd68183e68b3edaa5eb1cb","ja":"えっ、そうなの？　……そ、そうだよね！\n茜ちゃんが食レポしたんだもん♪","zh":"诶，是那样吗？……也、也是呢！\n毕竟是小茜做的美食探店嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"beefc63eb92b618c29781f96dcfcb29068edcf315964263b75a926b2a82ec8c3","ja":"やっぱり、茜ちゃんのカワイイ作戦が\n大成功だったんだね！","zh":"果然是因为小茜的可爱作战\n大获成功了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"34d72afb1b9862a5573da4cf7af1eb0f1e4c4bf65697e1a2dd9f4fc5131e5aa8","ja":"そ、そうですね……。","zh":"说、说得也是……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"3aede15e93e3303b72ce8e93a2a70153a0aaf487cde8be1b4a2c4f61dfceb460","ja":"次のカワイイ作戦もバッチリ決めて、視聴者の\nハートをキャッチしちゃうのだ～♪　ニャハハ♪","zh":"接下来的可爱作战也要完美搞定，牢牢抓住观众们的\n心～♪　喵哈哈♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"75903274e3a3bb7e5da68c61668991ec82f7daa44d43e02a9ee990ca191de9fc","ja":"（本当は、野々原さんのリアクションが面白くて、\n評判が良かったそうなのですが……）","zh":"（其实听说是因为野々原同学的反应很有趣，\n反响很不错的……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1088.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"295747ac00e797d489c7e05826c4528c7669f5e3cf1c6e0bff4762e2f889e72e","ja":"（こ、このことは、\nお伝えしない方が良いですね……）","zh":"（这、这件事情，\n还是不要告诉他比较好呢……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
